  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "So this might be a map specific issue, but figure its worth bringing up, since I dunno where the bug lies, but ive only noticed this in one map so far- Maldives Cottage - Daytime\n\nwrld_ef76b2bf-3259-4e06-8bd8-71431c84c613/info\n\nI changed the Forced Camera Near Distance and immediately the skybox vanished, leaving default unity sky. I tried rejoining to fix it, since changing back didnt fix it, and instead of joining, it crashed to desktop. I restarted, tried again to re-enter, same thing. So I realized the issue, turned the near distance off, and then it worked. \n\nagain, not sure where the issue lies, but worth bringing up.\n\nEDIT: happens in Nature ˸ GoldenValley (wrld_753cc4ed-42ac-42e6-b2a5-156085982381) too. in that one, changing it just straight up crashed the game.",
